  "details": "After watching the most recent post regarding the link with Persona to verify DOB for your account, I think you should consider allowing World Creators to tick a box that says their world is 18+, which would guarantee a minor cannot access the world.\n\nThis would be really helpful as there are a lot of club-themed worlds that advertise obvious 18+ services that shouldn't be viewed by minors regardless of the instance creator's intentions.",
